# Actor kind $85's start ($84:9602) with $07 bit 4 clear ($84:9614: sound
# $36 first), which no script meets. Power-on left alone (as attract.box);
# at frame 3600 the kind $85 actor at $0C9B ($07 = $11) is put back in its
# start state ($0C) with $07 = 1.
wait 3600
poke $000C9B 0C
poke $000CA2 01
wait 60
